The '''Party Realm''' was a special event location. It could be accessed through the [[Celebration Teleporter]] and contained unique NPCs, enemies, and raid bosses. Players could also earn and use [[Summer Token]]s, within this location.

Both the [[Celestial Domain]] and the [[Oni Realm]] were also located and can be accessed within the Party Realm, albeit without their respective gachas.

==Accessing==
{{For|the locations|Celebration Teleporter#Locations}}
The player could enter the Party Realm by interacting with the [[Celebration Teleporter]].

==Subareas==
* [[Celestial Domain]]
* [[Grand Colosseum]]
* [[Oni Realm]]
* Arena 1, Arena 2 & Arena Above.

